  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nEmbark on a surreal, psychedelic adventure to travel back and forth through time and rescue young Alice, helping her escape the uncanny, macabre and treacherous world of Styx. Unravel the metaphysical mystery of the grandchild cult and find out why they call you the monster!<p></p>\n<p>In the much anticipated follow up to Albino Lullaby; Alice’s Lullaby, players are plunged into a haunting narrative that challenges their perception of reality.</p>\n<p>Explore in first person as your world revolves around the desperate mission to rescue young Alice from the grasp of the enigmatic Grandchild Cult, a group whose madness has led them to construct a device capable of turning back time. As the only “walkling” with eyes, it is up to the player to navigate this dark world, traveling back and forth through time to uncover the mysteries hidden within Styx and prevent the cult from unleashing its horrors upon the world above.</p>\n",
